WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.720
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and Marvel is
going to be airing a super special first look

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:31.090
at footage from Avengers 2 Age of Ultron next
week, so for my Marvel Movie video today I

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:35.010
wanted to talk a little about what we’ve
learned about the story so far and how it

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.270
informs where all the phase 3 movies are going.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.910
I will be posting a breakdown of that Age
of Ultron footage as soon as it posts next

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.000
Tuesday too, so be sure to subscribe to get
it if you’re finding me for the first time.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.000
It’s going to be amazing.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.309
So first here’s some specific details about
the new footage.

00:00:46.309 --> 00:00:51.980
It’s going to air on ABC Tuesday March 18th
at 8PM Eastern Time during a special called

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.950
Marvel: Assembling A Universe.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:57.300
It’s a special they’re airing instead
of a new episode of Agents of SHIELD.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.580
It’s meant to be a deep look into the Marvel
Universe that integrates all of the movies

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:07.380
and TV Shows (remember that there will be
a few new TV Shows coming).

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.950
Integrates everything so that they can tell
one large story across multiple movies and

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:11.950
shows.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:15.179
There will be new footage from Avengers Age
of Ultron, Captain America The Winter Soldier

00:01:15.179 --> 00:01:16.470
and Guardians of The Galaxy.

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:20.410
I’ll talk about everything, but mostly my
breakdown will focus on Age of Ultron, since

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:23.250
this will be the first official footage we’ve
seen.

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.740
There have been a few pictures and clips of
them filming the movie, but they’re really

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:27.880
low quality.

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:33.079
Right now the only real footage of the movie
we’ve seen was the origin Comic Con announcement

00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:34.079
trailer.

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:36.670
Which was really only an image of Ultron.

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:39.920
Since then we’ve learned who most of the
new characters will be including Vision voiced

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.130
by Paul Bettany, who also does the voice of
JARVIS.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:46.650
There will probably be a motion capture element
to his performance as well as James Spader

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:47.650
who is voicing Ultron.

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:52.600
Then there’s the other two major additions,
Quicksilver played by Aaron Johnson and Scarlet

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.520
Witch played by Elizabeth Olsen.

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:58.340
Even if they aren’t featured in the video
next Tuesday, they are rumored to be in one

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:01.329
of the Captain America Winter Soldier Post
Credits Scenes.

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:04.420
So we will get to see what they look like
and what their powers look like on screen.

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:07.870
Isn’t it funny that X-Men Days of Future
Past features Quicksilver in a major role,

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:11.600
but we’re seeing the character for the first
time at the end of a totally different movie.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.170
I wonder how Bryan Singer and FOX feel about
that?

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:18.450
Thematically Age of Ultron is like the beginning
of a new age for Super Heroes and Super Villains

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.980
in the Marvel Universe.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.980
Think of it as The Age of Miracles, I would
call it the Age of Mutants.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.920
But since FOX legally has the rights to the
X-Men Franchise, only they get to use the

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:29.360
term “Mutant” in their movies.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.610
So Marvel is substituting the term “Miracles”
to broadly imply that Magic and other strange

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.080
abilities are going to play a huge role going
forward.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.440
It’s all just paving the way to The Infinity
Gauntlet.

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:46.430
A recent early review of Captain America Winter
Soldier included some spoilers for two separate

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.120
Post-Credits scenes.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:52.950
Turn the volume down now if you don’t want
to know anything about it.

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.340
So one of them was just a Winter Soldier specific
scene.

00:02:55.340 --> 00:03:01.230
But the other Post Credits clip was for Avengers
Age of Ultron.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.670
It also features Baron Von Strucker.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:07.480
He’s keeping them locked in an underground
cell and it’s just a quick shot of Quicksilver

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:12.709
bouncing around the walls at super speed and
Scarlet Witch levitating objects in the air.

00:03:12.709 --> 00:03:16.690
Strucker has the only dialogue and says The
Age of Miracle is upon us.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.631
Okay you can turn the volume back up now.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:19.631
Spoilers over.

00:03:19.631 --> 00:03:24.630
So let’s talk a little about Phase 3, because
Age of Ultron is the last movie before Ant

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.460
Man, the official beginning of that next phase
of movies.

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:31.810
Kevin Feige was quoted a couple years ago
as saying in the broad sense that Phase 3

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:33.099
represented Magic.

00:03:33.099 --> 00:03:37.620
Opening the door to all the Doctor Strange
rumors you may have been hearing recently.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:41.830
That movie hasn’t officially been announced,
but Marvel still has two untitled movies scheduled

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:47.330
for phase 3 in addition to Ant Man, Thor 3,
Captain America 3 and Avengers 3.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.379
In keeping with the theme of Magic, Doctor
Strange would be the logical choice for one

00:03:51.379 --> 00:03:52.420
of those movies.

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:56.580
There’s also the possibility of a female
driven movie like Black Widow.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:03:59.430
Marvel has said they’ve got more than one
in development, but nothing has been officially

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:00.430
announced.

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:03.799
Unofficially the rumor is that Ms Marvel is
the other film in development.

00:04:03.799 --> 00:04:07.190
Black Panther is another possibility for that
other untitled film.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.239
So now let’s talk a little about the plot
of Age of Ultron.

00:04:09.239 --> 00:04:13.920
We know a few details based on comments Joss
Whedon has made and behind the scenes images.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:17.930
After the initial Comic Con announcement last
year Whedon talked about the evolution of

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.269
Ultron during the movie.

00:04:20.269 --> 00:04:23.580
They are going to change his appearance, so
in his final version he won’t look like

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.490
the Comic Book version.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.419
The origin of the character is different too.

00:04:27.419 --> 00:04:31.780
I haven’t done an Ant Man video yet, but
Hank Pym in the movie won’t be his creator

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.800
like in the Comics.

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:38.720
In Age of Ultron he’s going to evolve from
a Military AI version of JARVIS, so essentially

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.720
Tony Stark will be his father.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.340
Whedon just said that they were doing it this
way because they wanted Ultron to flow from

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.080
things that they had already developed.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:50.800
And they’ve been developing the Tony Stark
character since 2008.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:54.730
On paper he shares a lot of similarities with
Hank Pym.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:58.600
But if you’ve read the comics, especially
recently with Marvel’s Avengers A.I.

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.600
series.

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.270
Hank Pym seems like he’s way more unstable
than Tony Stark.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:07.080
But since Stark Tech will give birth to Ultron,
you can understand why the voice of JARVIS,

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:10.640
Paul Bettany, is the logical choice to play
The Vision.

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:14.870
He’s an android that’s created by Ultron
to help him defeat the Avengers.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:19.040
So it will be Tony Stark giving birth to Ultron
giving birth to The Vision.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:23.340
So get excited, like Baron Von Strucker said,
this will be the Age of Miracles.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.360
So now that I’ve dropped all that info on
you let me know what you’re most excited

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:27.590
to see in the movie.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.590
Ultron?

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:29.590
Vision?

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:32.070
all the new powers from Quicksilver and Scarlet
Witch?

